  <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
    <li class="rounded-lg border p-4">
      <strong>GoHighLevel</strong> — the all-in-one CRM this whole blog is about. Pipelines,
      workflows, calendars, funnels, white-label SaaS mode.
      <a class="underline" href="https://www.gohighlevel.com/8342b9?fp_ref=dennis-50">
